+/* FF6 variant: FF6_REF_INPUT_FILE=<file> replays the joypad 1 log of the A side
+ * (src/game_rtl.c, FF6_COSIM_INPUT_LOG): one line "frame hexmask" per change, in frame
+ * order; the mask holds from that frame (frames run before it, counted from reset) until
